{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSChipPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"single","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": used to select only one option within the others","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"multiple","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": used to select several options within the others","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each chip contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker will expose choosen values through this “tag”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSFilterChip","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPickerData","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."}]},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in filter chip using OUDSChipPickerData.","    enum Drink: String, CaseIterable {","        case virginHolyLava, ipaBeer, mineralWater","    }","","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSChipPickerData<Drink>] {","        [","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.virginHolyLava,","                               layout: .textAndIcon(\"Virgin Holy Lava\", icon: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Dring.ipaBeer,","                               layout: .textAndIcon(\"IPA Beer\", icon: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.mineralWater,","                               layout: .textAndIcon(\"Mineral water\", icon: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/\/ Single selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: Drink = .mineralWater","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selection: $selection, chips: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/\/ Multiple selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [Drink] = [.mineralWater]","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selections: $selections, chips: someDataToPopulate)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Theme-rendering","text":"Theme rendering","type":"heading","level":2},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Orange","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Orange Business Tools","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Business-Tools","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_OrangeBusinessTools","type":"image"}]},{"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Wireframe","type":"image"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.17.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudschippicker"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","